dence\n\n- Before: no deployment workflow and analytics configuration unset.\n- After: Pages uses Actions and the custom domain. Phase-A account domain\n  verification preceded serving DNS; analytics configuration is committed.\n  API readbacks and the account report are linked in the PR outcome comment.\n- Recovered onto the merged first-load flash fix (#34/main 4a67ce9) with all\n  three patches unchanged. Final local `pnpm validate` passed: 222 tests and\n  static build, with fixture data and installed Chrome via `SITE_BROWSER`.\n- Pinned standards check, whole-change diff check, fresh internal Standards\n  and Spec reviews passed at ba4df05244b07a129f3be07f895a5b44179d104a.\n- The built-HTML test verifies a single deferred analytics beacon on every\n  page, while unit coverage retains the no-token behavior. The deployment\n  workflow selects supported Node 24 explicitly.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** deployment\n\nMerge triggers the first production build with live project data and deploys\nthrough GitHub Pages. Failed builds preserve the previous deployment. The\nfirst-load hold is released: #33 closed via #34. HTTPS enforcement follows\ncertificate availability; Search Console/Bing, analytics reporting, deployed\nLighthouse and the first scheduled run remain post-merge issue criteria.\n\n## Related issue\n\nPart of #13","timestamp":"2026-11-03T10:23:39Z","author":{"name":"Jasper","email":"jasperlutzseverino@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1441407321,"node_id":"R_kgDOVeohWQ","name":"receiver","full_name":"lutzseverino/receiver","private":false,"owner":{"login":"lutzseverino","id":28309837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MzA5ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28309837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lutzseverino","html_url":"https://github.com/lutzseverino","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lutzseverino/followers","follo